// v1.9.2 release highlights
"What’s New in v1.9.2" = "v1.9.2 新功能";
"Release highlights for v1.9.2." = "v1.9.2 主要更新。";
"Delete the previous word with Option-Delete on macOS, including Unicode text." = "在 macOS 上使用 Option-Delete 删除前一个单词，包括 Unicode 文本。";
"Keep mobile editor actions and AI settings accessible from the first layout." = "首次布局时即可访问移动端编辑操作和 AI 设置。";
"Optionally rank external AI chat context with explicit TypeSafe consent and conservative fallback." = "明确同意向 TypeSafe 发送数据后，可选择筛选外部 AI 聊天上下文，并在不确定时保留原内容。";
